    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="4">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAs">II As</ref> 4</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Be hlafordsearwum. Ond we cwædon be hlafordsearwe, ðæt he beo his feores scyldig, gif he his ætsacan ne mihte oþþe eft on þam þrimfealdum ordale ful wære.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And we have declared with regard to one who is accused of plotting against his lord, that he shall forfeit his life if he cannot deny it, or [if he does deny it and] is afterwards found guilty in the threefold ordeal.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">[Be hlafordsyrwum.] And we cwædon be hlafordsearwan, þæt he wære his feores scyldig, gyf he hit ætsacan ne mihte oððe on ðam ðryfealdan ordale fúl wære.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
